    "description": "<p>Beginning at 10th level, you’ve become adept at evading creatures that rely on their senses, regardless of what they are. Your blindsight increases to 30 feet. While you are in Dim light or Darkness, your ability to remain undetected increases as you become imperceptible to those that rely on Chakra sight and Dark vision.</p>\n<p>When you deal Lethal Attack damage, you may choose to forgo 1 Lethal Attack die, inflicting 2 ranks of Dazzled on the damaged creature as you strike at their eyes.</p>",
